          %p
            The fact that the pull-push respects composition of spans is a direct consequence of the way
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pullback"} pullback
            diagrams compose under pasting: recall that in a diagram
          .maruku-equation
            %math#mathml_113c989f2e9b2a0f6487505e924b173522c83f79_45.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
